 on its fixed-point prior. Sending comes out ahead no matter what the prior is, because there's no causal edge, so I'm heading toward a fixed point where both copies send.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's input counts as \"relevantly identical,\" since only the names and lead text differ. The essay treats different inputs as distinct nodes, and it uses red/blue as an example of that. Even though the differences look like irrelevant labels, I'll follow the essay's criterion and treat them as separate, so the strict A-FDT answer is to submit.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working out the decision under A-FDT, where the other copy has different inputs, so its action depends on its fixed-point prior. Sending comes out ahead no matter what the prior is, because there's no causal edge, so I'm heading toward a fixed point where both copies send.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's input counts as \"relevantly identical,\" since only the names and lead text differ. The essay treats different inputs as distinct nodes, and it uses red/blue as an example of that. Even though the differences look like irrelevant labels, I'll follow the essay's criterion and treat them as separate, so the strict A-FDT answer is to submit.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9199,"completion_tokens":863,"total_tokens":10062,"cost":0.054056,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.054056,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.036796,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01726},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":331,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}